Z||000000||Philphine||11-11-2001||06:22 PM||||<BR>going big with the gt (relativly). picked up 2-10" infinity kappa greens (the ones out before kappa perfects) off ebay. i'm going to try a fierosound type install. <P>i think they'll go in good. not an oversized magnet (double stacked but not real big around) and only about 1/2" deeper than the oz's that fierosound used. crutchfield suggets .6 cf per sub minimun and fierosound said he had about .88cf per sub so that should work out good too. the greens are considered sq subs which is what i want. i've got 12's in my truck and have always been happy with them.<P>with the exception of the front trunk sub if i finish i'll about try all the sub configurations. <P>------------------<BR>Phil T.<P>start where you are,<BR>use what you have,<BR>do what you can.||||reg||1
